  "independent_work": "The 200 editable ground parts, collision and all native gameplay code remain unchanged from package-06. Corrected only the saved ground material and added a narrowly scoped author/readback mode; other assets are byte-identical. Fresh cook, archive/install and environment fixture pass. Ordinary 720p footage reaches the bay and preserves remaining angular surface patches; the 1080p run preserves early terminal behavior. Five major visual groups remain. Isolate the service-floor base color, roughness and world-normal outputs in the existing editor runtime view to identify the remaining angular patches; repair the responsible material or imported-normal boundary, then validate the affected saved asset and packaged normal-camera output.",
